+// chacha20-poly1305 out of its supported cipher list and connections to
+// servers that only offer it fail with "Unsupported algorithm".
+//
+// The IV layout matches OpenSSL's EVP_chacha20: the first 32 bits (little
+// endian) are the block counter, the remaining 96 bits are the nonce.
